From ea9b66555526b9261491fe965c707588817c3820 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jan 2024 14:55:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0493/1695] dts: stm32: sync stm32mp25 with 3.19.0-stm32mp-dev

Synchronize STM32MP25 DTS/DTSI files with 3.19.0-stm32mp-dev branch
commit 2cc216af311d ("plat-stm32mp2: enable async notif with GIC PPI 15").

- Add stm32mp157f-dk helper DTSI files to configure RIF, RCC and reserved
  memory for when Cortex-A secure world is TDCID on the MP25 platform.
- Add DTS nodes for HASH, CRYPT, PKA and SAES in SoC DTSI files.
- Add Vrefbuf node in SoC DTSI file.
- Add I2C1 resources in SoC DTSI file.
- Add "syscon" compatible string identifier in EXTI nodes.
- There are 2 OEM encoding keys, not 1, in BSEC nvmem node.
- Set st,shadow-lock property in shadow-prov node ("st,provisioning").
- Set delay contraints for PMIC regulator LDO1.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 45cbbb062e31799e6a70e2fcfcf40c2370da2a3d dts: stm32: sync stm32mp25 with 3.19.0-stm32mp-dev]
Change-Id: I2c834c25033247a99808bb90112a0810c47b9478
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/352663
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
